  <section id="process" class="cf-section cf-geo-process wow fadeInUp"><div class="container"><div class="cf-section-heading"><span class="hero-kicker"><cfif local.isEs>Cómo se trabaja<cfelse>How it works</cfif></span><h2><cfif local.isEs>De la evidencia a las prioridades.<cfelse>From evidence to priorities.</cfif></h2></div><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-4"><article class="cf-step-card"><span class="cf-step-number">1</span><h3><cfif local.isEs>Auditar<cfelse>Audit</cfif></h3><p><cfif local.isEs>Entender la arquitectura, el contenido público y las señales técnicas actuales.<cfelse>Understand the architecture, public content, and current technical signals.</cfif></p></article></div><div class="col-md-4"><article class="cf-step-card"><span class="cf-step-number">2</span><h3><cfif local.isEs>Priorizar<cfelse>Prioritize</cfif></h3><p><cfif local.isEs>Separar quick wins, correcciones necesarias y mejoras de largo plazo.<cfelse>Separate quick wins, necessary corrections, and longer-term improvements.</cfif></p></article></div><div class="col-md-4"><article class="cf-step-card"><span class="cf-step-number">3</span><h3><cfif local.isEs>Implementar y validar<cfelse>Implement and validate</cfif></h3><p><cfif local.isEs>Aplicar cambios, comprobar HTML, metadatos y schemas, y documentar cómo mantenerlos.<cfelse>Apply changes, check HTML, metadata, and schemas, and document how to maintain them.</cfif></p></article></div></div></div></section>

  <section id="fit" class="cf-section wow fadeInUp"><div class="container"><div class="cf-section-heading"><span class="hero-kicker"><cfif local.isEs>Para quién<cfelse>Who it is for</cfif></span><h2><cfif local.isEs>Para sitios y aplicaciones existentes que necesitan claridad técnica.<cfelse>For existing sites and applications that need technical clarity.</cfif></h2><p><cfif local.isEs>El servicio se adapta a ColdFusion/CFML, Lucee, WordPress, PHP y otras arquitecturas. Es especialmente útil al renovar un sitio, publicar servicios nuevos, ordenar un portfolio, corregir problemas de indexación o preparar contenido técnico para audiencias y sistemas automatizados.<cfelse>The service adapts to ColdFusion/CFML, Lucee, WordPress, PHP, and other architectures. It is especially useful when refreshing a site, publishing new services, organizing a portfolio, fixing indexation problems, or preparing technical content for people and automated systems.</cfif></p></div></div></section>

  <section id="faq" class="cf-section is-soft wow fadeInUp"><div class="container"><div class="cf-section-heading"><span class="hero-kicker">FAQ</span><h2><cfif local.isEs>Preguntas frecuentes.<cfelse>Common questions.</cfif></h2></div><div class="cf-faq">
